[h2]Initial Release 1.0.0[/h2]

[list]
[*]Merged Community Flavor Pack and Renovatio gene and portrait-modifier files into a single set to prevent file-level replacement conflicts.
[*]Restores clothing, headgear, legwear, and visual traits from both mods in a single playset.
[*]Supports CK3 1.19.0.6.
[/list]

Load this patch after both Community Flavor Pack and Renovatio. Start a new campaign after installing.
